---
import GolfBall from './GolfBall.astro';
---
<dialog id="film-dialog" class="film-dialog" aria-labelledby="film-title"><div class="dialog-head"><span id="film-title">VILLA CARISSA · MONTAGE PHOTO</span><button data-close aria-label="Fermer le film">✕</button></div><video controls playsinline preload="none" data-poster="/assets/photo-25.webp" data-src="/assets/villa-carissa-film.mp4"></video><p>Une visite en images, réalisée avec les photographies de la villa.</p></dialog><dialog id="photo-dialog" class="photo-dialog" aria-label="Galerie photos de la Villa Carissa"><div class="dialog-head"><span id="photo-count"></span><button data-close aria-label="Fermer la photo">✕</button></div><div class="lightbox-stage"><button id="photo-prev" aria-label="Photo précédente"><GolfBall /><span>Précédente</span></button><img id="lightbox-image" alt="" decoding="async"><button id="photo-next" aria-label="Photo suivante"><GolfBall /><span>Suivante</span></button></div><p id="photo-caption"></p><p id="photo-status" class="sr-only" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></p></dialog>